{"id":202,"flavor":[{"games":["Shield","Y","SoulSilver","FireRed","Silver"],"text":"To keep its pitch-black tail hidden, it lives quietly in the darkness. It is never first to attack."},{"games":["Sword","LeafGreen","Gold"],"text":"It hates light and shock. If attacked, it inflates its body to pump up its counterstrike."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Sapphire"],"text":"Wobbuffet does nothing but endure attacks—it won’t attack on its own. However, it won’t endure an attack on its tail. When that happens, the Pokémon will try to take the foe with it using Destiny Bond."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","Ruby"],"text":"If two or more Wobbuffet meet, they will turn competitive and try to outdo each other’s endurance. However, they may try to see which one can endure the longest without food. Trainers need to beware of this habit."},{"games":["X","HeartGold"],"text":"It hates light and shock. If attacked, it inflates its body to build up its counterstrike."},{"games":["White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"It desperately tries to keep its black tail hidden. It is said to be proof the tail hides a secret."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"Usually docile, a WOBBUFFET strikes back ferociously if its black tail is attacked. It makes its lair in caves where it waits for nightfall."},{"games":["Crystal"],"text":"In order to conceal its black tail, it lives in a dark cave and only moves about at night."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Shadow Tag","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon steps on the opposing Pokémon's shadows to prevent them from fleeing or switching out."},{"name":"Telepathy","hidden":true,"description":"The Pokémon anticipates and dodges the attacks of its allies."}],"eggGroups":["Amorphous"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":20,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium","habitat":"cave","color":"Blue","shape":"Blob","evolution":{"id":360,"name":"Wynaut","condition":null,"children":[{"id":202,"name":"Wobbuffet","condition":"Lv. 15","children":[]}]},"